      "description": "The author's official homepage leads to each separately published canonical Parent original; the 2025 /theory-archive/ page is a narrow three-document publication experiment and not this entire corpus. The 313 documented originals permit context-dependent and cross-source applications beyond a fixed list."
    },
    {
      "@type": "Dataset",
