      "alternateName": "中川マスター：外部OSSへの実装・マージ実績の一次証拠",
      "description": "Evidence-first map of 14 merged GitHub pull requests in 8 independent receiving software projects (Qwen Code, OpenClaw, Pydantic AI, MemberJunction, PostHog, Hermes Agent, LiteLLM, Turboembed). Records distinguish Nakagawa Master's public source-level observations from the receiving engineers' actual implementations and exact merge receipts; Qwen and Hermes official release ancestry is separately confirmed. PostHog's three PRs are one successor workstream. The linked Japanese, English and Chinese human-facing record documents 61 cases at different stages.",
      "creator": {
        "@id": "https://master.ricette.jp/#nakagawa-master"
      },
